onibara ni iraye si Restrict Content Pro.','Ultimate Member'=>'Ultimate Member','Send Ultimate Member welcome emails for new customers.'=>'Rán awọn imeeli ikini Ultimate Member fun awọn onibara tuntun.','Elementor'=>'Elementor','Choose Elementor templates for checkout components.'=>'Yan awọn awoṣe Elementor fun awọn eroja isanwo.','Divi'=>'Divi','Use PublishPress Cart order forms inside Divi layouts.'=>'Lo awọn fọọmu aṣẹ PublishPress Cart ninu awọn apẹrẹ Divi.','Oxygen Builder'=>'Oxygen Builder','Use PublishPress Cart conditions in Oxygen Builder.'=>'Lo awọn ipo PublishPress Cart ninu Oxygen Builder.','Gutenberg'=>'Gutenberg','Use PublishPress Cart blocks in the WordPress block editor.'=>'Lo awọn bulọọki PublishPress Cart ninu olootu bulọọki WordPress.','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Connect PublishPress Cart products with WooCommerce flows.'=>'So awọn ọja PublishPress Cart pọ pẹlu awọn ṣiṣan WooCommerce.','WP Domain Checker'=>'WP Domain Checker','Sell domains through WP Domain Checker checkout flows.'=>'Ta awọn agbegbe nipasẹ awọn ṣiṣan isanwo WP Domain Checker.','Cancel an existing subscription as an order automation.'=>'Fagilee ìforúkọsílẹ tó wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìmúlò àṣẹ.','Refund Order'=>'Pàdà Owó Ìṣẹ́','Refund an existing order as an order automation.'=>'Pàdà ìṣẹ́ tó wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìmúlò àṣẹ.','Webhook'=>'Webhook','Send order data to an external webhook URL.'=>'Rán data ìṣẹ́ sí URL webhook ti ita.','All'=>'Gbogbo','Email Marketing'=>'Ìpolówó Imeeli','Analytics'=>'Iṣiro','Ads'=>'Àwọn ìpolówó','Automation'=>'Ìmúlò àṣẹ','Courses'=>'Kọ́ọ̀sì','Membership'=>'Ìmembership','Security'=>'Ààbò','Builders'=>'Àwọn Olùdásílẹ̀','Cash on Delivery'=>'Owo lori Ifijiṣẹ','Manage Cash on Delivery'=>'Ṣakoso Owo lori Ifijiṣẹ','Allow customers to pay with cash when their order is delivered.'=>'Gba àwọn onibara laaye láti sanwo pẹ̀lú owó nígbà tí a bá fi ìṣẹ́ wọn ránṣẹ́.','Manage'=>'Ṣakoso','Stripe'=>'Stripe','Manage Stripe'=>'Ṣakoso Stripe','Accept credit cards and other payments securely via 