er Lifetime Value'=>'Iye igbesi aye onibara','All-time average across %s matching customers'=>'Gbogbo àkúnya àtijọ́ kúrò ní %s àwọn onibara tó ba mu','All-time average across %s customers'=>'Àtẹ̀jáde àgbóyé kaakiri %s onibara','%s active recurring subscriptions'=>'%s àfojúsùn àtúnṣe to n ṣiṣẹ́','Churn Rate'=>'Iwọn Churn','Transactions'=>'Ìṣòwò','%1$s new, %2$s renewals'=>'%1$s tuntun, %2$s ìmúpadà','Paid orders and post-purchase offers'=>'Àṣẹ ti a san ati awọn ìfilọ́ láti ra lẹ́yìn rira','Avg Order Value'=>'Iye Àṣẹ Apapọ','Based on paid transactions'=>'Da lori awọn ìṣòwò ti a san','Revenue Trend'=>'Ilana Èrè','Subscription Health'=>'Ilera Ìforúkọsílẹ','Local subscription records'=>'Àkọsílẹ ìforúkọsílẹ àgbègbè','New'=>'Tuntun','Top Products by Revenue'=>'Àwọn Ọja Tó Gíga Pẹ̀lú Èrè','Paid order amount'=>'Iye àṣẹ ti a san','No paid product revenue found for this period.'=>'Kò sí èrè ọja tó san tí a rí fún àkókò yìí.','Payment Method Mix'=>'Apopọ Ọna ìsanwó','Transactions by gateway'=>'Ìṣòwò nípasẹ̀ ẹnu-ọna','No payment method data found for this period.'=>'Kò sí ìtàn data ọna ìsanwó tó rí fún àkókò yìí.','Detailed order breakdown'=>'Iye aṣẹ alaye','Net Sales'=>'Tita Neti','Total Refunds'=>'Apapọ pada','Amount Refunded'=>'Iye ti a pada','Avg Revenue per Customer'=>'Iwọn owo-wiwọle apapọ fun alabara','Sales by Product'=>'Tita nipasẹ Ọja','No product sales in this period'=>'Ko si tita ọja ni akoko yii','Completed paid orders will appear here once customers buy a product in the selected date range.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a ti sanwo yoo han nibi ni kete ti awọn alabara ba ra ọja ni agbegbe ọjọ ti a yan.','Refunds by Product'=>'Pada nipasẹ Ọja','No product refunds in this period'=>'Ko si pada ọja ni akoko yii','Refunded products will appear here when an order refund is recorded for the selected date range.'=>'Awọn ọja ti a pada yoo han nibi nigbati a ba ṣe igbasilẹ pada aṣẹ fun agbegbe ọjọ ti a yan.','Transactions by Payment Gateway'=>'Iṣowo nipasẹ Owo-ori Sisan','No gateway transactions in this period'=>'Ko si iṣowo owo-ori ni akoko yii','Paid transactions will be grouped by gateway here after checkout activity is recorded.'=>'Awọn iṣowo ti a sanwo yoo wa ni ẹgbẹ nipasẹ owo-ori nibi lẹhin ti a ti ṣe igbasilẹ iṣẹ-ṣiṣe checkout.','Orders by Type'=>'Àwọn Ìbèèrè nipasẹ Irú','Main Orders by Product'=>'Awọn aṣẹ Pataki nipasẹ Ọja','No main orders in this period'=>'Ko si awọn aṣẹ pataki ni akoko yii','Main product order counts will appear here once paid checkout orders are tracked.'=>'Iye aṣẹ ọja akọkọ yoo han nibi ni kete ti a ti tọpinpin awọn aṣẹ ti a sanwo.','Customer report for %s'=>'Iroyin onibara fun %s','Back to Contacts'=>'Padà si Awọn olubasọrọ','View Orders'=>'Wo Awọn aṣẹ','Customer activity'=>'Iṣe onibara','Report date range'=>'Iye akoko iroyin','Average Order'=>'Aṣẹ Apapọ','Customer report tabs'=>'Awọn taabu iroyin onibara','Subscriptions'=>'Awọn Iforukọsilẹ','Order Timeline'=>'Akoko Aṣẹ','Paid, refunded, upsell, downsell, and bump activity for the selected period.'=>'Ti a san, ti da pada, upsell, downsell, ati iṣẹlẹ bump fun akoko ti a yan.','Open Orders List'=>'Atokọ Awọn aṣẹ Tuntun','View Order'=>'Wo Aṣẹ','No orders in this date range'=>'Ko si awọn aṣẹ ni agbegbe ọjọ yii','Try a broader date range or open the full orders list for this customer.'=>'Gbiyanju agbegbe ọjọ ti o gbooro tabi ṣii atokọ awọn aṣẹ kikun fun alabara yii.','Recurring plans, status, collected revenue, and remaining payments for this customer.'=>'Awọn eto atunwi, ipo, owo ti a gba, ati awọn sisanwo to ku fun alabara yii.','Open Subscriptions List'=>'Atokọ Awọn Iwe Iṣowo Tuntun','Plan'=>'Eto','Total Revenue'=>'Apapọ Owo ti a gba','Remaining Payments'=>'Awọn Sisanwo to ku','No subscriptions in this date range'=>'Ko si awọn iwe iṣowo ni agbegbe ọjọ yii','Try a broader date range or open the full subscriptions list for this customer.'=>'Gbiyanju agbegbe ọjọ ti o gbooro tabi ṣii atokọ awọn iwe iṣowo kikun fun alabara yii.','Customer details'=>'Alabara alaye','Customer Details'=>'Alabara Alaye','Location'=>'Ibi','WordPress Account'=>'Akọọlẹ WordPress','Guest checkout'=>'Iforukọsilẹ alejo','Customer ID'=>'ID alabara','Last Gateway'=>'Ikẹhin Gateway','Customer History'=>'Itan alabara','First Order'=>'Àṣẹ àkọ́kọ́','Last Order'=>'Àṣẹ tó kẹhin','Products Purchased'=>'Àwọn ọja tí a ra','Subscription Revenue'=>'Ìdáhùn ìforúkọsílẹ̀','Export Subscriptions'=>'Gbigba Awọn Iforukọsilẹ','Upsell'=>'Loke','Downsell'=>'Isalẹ','Order'=>'Aṣẹ','Order Bump'=>'Ibere Bump','Guest customer'=>'Onibara alejo','All time'=>'Gbogbo akoko','No data for this period'=>'Ko si data fun akoko yii','No revenue in this period'=>'Ko si owo-wiwọle ni akoko yii','Paid orders will appear in this chart after checkout activity is recorded for the selected date range.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ti a san yoo han ni shatti yii lẹhin ti iṣẹ ṣiṣe sisanwo ti wa ni igbasilẹ fun akoko ọjọ ti a yan.','Revenue trend chart'=>'Shatti aṣa owo-wiwọle','Unknown product'=>'Ọja ti a ko mọ','Stripe needs a temporary restricted key with %s. We use it once, install the endpoint, and never store it.'=>'Stripe nilo bọtini to ni àkóso àkókò pẹ̀lú %s. A lo o lẹ́kan, fi ẹnu-ọna si, ki a si má ṣe fipamọ́ rẹ.','Webhook endpoints: Write'=>'Ìbèèrè Webhook: Kọ','Temporary Stripe key'=>'Bọtini Stripe àkókò','Install webhook'=>'Fi webhook si','Create the key in Stripe'=>'Ṣẹda bọtini ní Stripe','I want to set it up in Stripe myself'=>'Mo fẹ́ ṣeto rẹ ní Stripe fúnra mi','Create an endpoint in Stripe with this URL:'=>'Ṣẹda ẹnu-ọna ní Stripe pẹ̀lú URL yìí:','Select the %d events listed in our documentation, then paste that endpoint signing secret:'=>'Yan %d àwọn iṣẹlẹ tó wà nínú ìwé àkọsílẹ wa, lẹhinna lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi àkọsílẹ ẹnu-ọna naa:','Signing secret'=>'Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si','Save'=>'Fipamọ́','Add a Stripe secret key for this mode first.'=>'Ṣe afikun bọtini asiri Stripe fún ìṣàkóso yìí kọ́kọ́.','Stripe cannot reach a local address. Forward events with Stripe CLI to %s'=>'Stripe kò le dé adirẹsi agbegbe. Tún àwọn iṣẹlẹ pẹ̀lú Stripe CLI sí %s','Some events are missing, so parts of your store will not update.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn iṣẹlẹ ń kọ́, nítorí náà apá diẹ ninu ìtajà rẹ kò ní ṣe àtúnṣe.','This account does not let us re-check the endpoint, so no live status is shown.'=>'Àkọọlẹ yìí kò jẹ́ kí a tún ṣayẹwo ẹnu-ọna naa, nítorí náà, ko si ipo gidi ti a fi hàn.','Webhook check failed: %s'=>'Ìṣàkóso webhook kuna: %s','You are not allowed to configure Stripe webhooks.'=>'O kò gba laaye láti ṣàtúnṣe Stripe webhooks.','That key does not look like a Stripe key for the selected mode. Copy a restricted key that starts with rk_, or a secret key that starts with sk_.'=>'Bọtini yẹn kò jọ bọtini Stripe fún irú ti a yan. Daakọ bọtini to ni àkóso ti o bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu rk_, tàbí bọtini asiri ti o bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu sk_.','Webhook is active and the signing secret is saved. The key you pasted was not stored, so you can delete it in Stripe now.'=>'Webhook ti wa ni iṣe ati pe àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ti fipamọ́. Bọtini ti o lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han kò ti fipamọ́, nítorí náà, o le pa a ni Stripe bayii.','Webhook events were updated. The key you pasted was not stored, so you can delete it in Stripe now.'=>'Àwọn iṣẹlẹ webhook ti ṣe àtúnṣe. Bọtini ti o lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han kò ti fipamọ́, nítorí náà, o le pa a ni Stripe bayii.','That webhook endpoint already existed, so Stripe did not return a signing secret. Open the endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard, copy the signing secret, and paste it below.'=>'Ẹnu-ọna webhook yẹn ti wa tẹlẹ, nítorí náà Stripe kò dá àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si padà. Ṣí ẹnu-ọna naa ní Dashboard Stripe rẹ, daakọ àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si, ki o si lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han ní isalẹ.','A Stripe signing secret starts with whsec_. Copy it again from the webhook endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard.'=>'Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si Stripe bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú whsec_. Daakọ rẹ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si láti ẹnu-ọna webhook ní Dashboard Stripe rẹ.','Signing secret saved. Send a test event from Stripe to confirm that your site accepts it.'=>'Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ti fipamọ́. Rán iṣẹlẹ ìdánwò láti Stripe láti jẹ́risi pé ojú-ìtà rẹ gba a.','Paste a Stripe key or a signing secret before you save.'=>'Lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi bọtini Stripe tàbí àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ṣáájú ki o tó fipamọ́.','This connected account cannot update webhooks automatically. Paste a restricted key with Webhook endpoints: Write, or create the endpoint in Stripe yourself.'=>'Àkọọlẹ ti a so pọ̀ yìí kò le ṣe àtúnṣe awọn webhook laifọwọyi. Lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi bọtini to ni àkóso pẹ̀lú Ìbèèrè Webhook: Kọ, tàbí ṣẹda ẹnu-ọna ní Stripe fúnra rẹ.','Stripe webhook is configured for the selected mode.'=>'Webhook Stripe ti wa ni tunto fun ipo ti a yan.','Cannot configure webhooks without a Stripe secret key for the active mode.'=>'Kò le tunto awọn webhooks laisi bọtini aṣiri Stripe fun ipo ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Stripe cannot reach local-only webhook URLs (like .test/.local). Use a public tunnel URL for webhook testing, or use Stripe CLI forwarding while testing locally.'=>'Stripe kò le de ọdọ awọn URL webhook ti agbegbe nikan (gẹgẹbi .test/.local). Lo URL ikanni gbogbogbo fun idanwo webhook, tabi lo ikanni Stripe CLI ni akoko idanwo agbegbe.','This connected account token cannot manage webhooks automatically. Please create the webhook manually in Stripe dashboard for the active mode.'=>'Bọtini akọọlẹ ti a so pọ ko le ṣakoso awọn webhooks laifọwọyi. Jọwọ ṣẹda webhook naa ni ọwọ ni dashboard Stripe fun ipo ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Currency'=>'Owó','Default Country'=>'Orilẹ-ede Aiyipada','Currency Position'=>'Ipo Owó','Thousand Separator'=>'Ayẹwo ẹgbẹrun','Decimal Separator'=>'Ayẹwo oniduro','Number of Decimals'=>'Iye ti awọn nọmba oniyipada','The number of decimal points shown in prices.'=>'Iye ti awọn aaye oniyipada ti a fihan ninu awọn idiyele.','My Account Page'=>'Oju-iwe Akọọlẹ Mi','Hide free orders in My Account'=>'Pa awọn aṣẹ ọfẹ mọ ni Akọọlẹ Mi','Turn on to hide free orders from the "Orders" tab in My Account'=>'Tan-an lati pa awọn aṣẹ ọfẹ mọ lati taabu "Awọn aṣẹ" ni Akọọlẹ Mi','Terms and Conditions URL'=>'URL Awọn ofin ati Awọn ipo','Privacy Policy URL'=>'URL Ilana Asiri','Company Address'=>'Adirẹsi Ile-iṣẹ','Logo Image'=>'Aworan Logo','Enable product duplicate action'=>'Mu iṣe ẹda ọja ṣiṣẹ','Show the Duplicate row action for products in wp-admin.'=>'Fihan iṣe ẹda ila fun awọn ọja ninu wp-admin.','Email reports and confirmations to'=>'Imeeli awọn iroyin ati awọn ìmúdájú si','admin@example.com, another@example.com'=>'admin@example.com, another@example.com','Recipients for sales reports and order confirmations. Comma-separated.'=>'Awọn olugba fun awọn iroyin tita ati awọn ìmúdájú aṣẹ. Pin pẹlu koma.','Email Report Schedule'=>'Iṣeto Iroyin Imeeli','Daily'=>'Ọjọ́gbọn','Weekly'=>'Ọsẹ','Semi monthly'=>'Àkókò osù mejì','How often summary reports should be emailed.'=>'Bawo ni igbagbogbo awọn iroyin akopọ yẹ ki o wa ni imeeli.','"From" Name'=>'"Lati" Oruko','"From" Email'=>'"Lati" Imeeli','Reply-To Email'=>'Imeeli Idahun-Si','Optional reply address used by transactional emails and inherited by product notifications.'=>'Adirẹsi idahun ti a yan ti a lo nipasẹ awọn imeeli iṣowo ati pe a gba nipasẹ awọn akiyesi ọja.','Footer text'=>'Ọrọ ẹsẹ','Test email'=>'Imeeli idanwo','Order Received'=>'Aṣẹ ti a gba','New User Welcome'=>'Ikini Olumulo Tuntun','Purchase Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Rira','Order Refunded'=>'Aṣẹ ti da pada','Trial Ending Reminder'=>'Iṣọra ipari idanwo','Upcoming Renewal Reminder'=>'Iṣọra imudojuiwọn ti n bọ','Subscription Renewal Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Imudojuiwọn Iwe-iyẹwo','Failed Renewal Payment'=>'Iṣeduro Ipadabọ ti kuna','Subscription Canceled Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Fagile Iwe-iyẹwo','Subscription Paused Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Iwe-iyẹwo ti dawọ duro','Preview Email'=>'Iṣafihan Imeeli','Send Test'=>'Firanṣẹ idanwo','Preview and test emails use sample order data for personalization tags.'=>'Iṣafihan ati idanwo awọn imeeli lo data aṣẹ apẹẹrẹ fun awọn ami iṣ personalized.','Send to admin?'=>'Firanṣẹ si admin?','Body Text'=>'Ọrọ Ara','Use WordPress Default Notification'=>'Lo Ifitonileti Aiyipada WordPress','If enabled, WordPress default new user notification will be used instead of custom email template.'=>'Ti o ba ti muu ṣiṣẹ, ifitonileti olumulo tuntun aiyipada WordPress ni a yoo lo dipo awoṣe imeeli ti adani.','Body'=>'Ara','Enable/Disable'=>'Muu ṣiṣẹ/Mu ṣiṣẹ','Use date tokens {D}, {DD}, {M}, {MM}, {YY}, {YYYY}, {H}, {HH}, {N}, {S}, and custom alphanumeric characters. Example: INV-{YYYY}{MM}{DD}.'=>'Lo awọn itẹ́wọ́gbà ọjọ́ {D}, {DD}, {M}, {MM}, {YY}, {YYYY}, {H}, {HH}, {N}, {S}, ati awọn ohun alphanumeric ti a ṣe adani. Àpẹẹrẹ: INV-{YYYY}{MM}{DD}.','Learn more'=>'Kọ́ ẹ̀kọ́ síi','Custom Invoice Numbering'=>'Iye nọmba iwe-ẹri adani','Attach invoice to order received emails'=>'So iwe-ẹri pọ si awọn imeeli ti a gba aṣẹ','Attach invoice to purchase confirmation emails'=>'So iwe-ẹri pọ si awọn imeeli ìmúṣẹ rira','Attach invoice to subscription renewal emails'=>'So iwe-ẹri pọ si awọn imeeli ìmúṣẹ ìmúpadà','Invoice Prefix'=>'Prefix Iwe-ẹri','Invoice Suffix'=>'Suffix Iwe-ẹri','Invoice Length'=>'Iwọn Ìwé ìfowopamọ','Invoice Format'=>'Àtúnṣe Ìwé ìfowopamọ','Current Invoice Number'=>'Nọ́mbà Ìwé ìfowopamọ Tó Wà Lọwọ́lọwọ','API'=>'API','GOING LIVE? Click the "Update" button on any subscription products created on the Test API after switching this setting to Live!'=>'ṢE IGBÀ LÍVE? Tẹ bọtini "Ìmúdájú" lórí eyikeyi awọn ọja àbò tí a ṣẹda lórí Test API lẹ́yìn tí a yí àṣàyàn yìí sí Live!','More Information'=>'Alaye diẹ sii','Connection Status'=>'Ipo Asopọ','Checkout experience'=>'Iriri Checkout','Express Payment'=>'Sanwo ni kiakia','Customer Portal'=>'Ẹnu-ọna Onibara','Hosted Checkout'=>'Checkout ti a gbalejo','Payment Element'=>'Elemẹnti Ìsanwo','Statement Descriptor'=>'Apejuwe Iwe-ẹri','Required. 22 character maximum, no special characters'=>'Nilo. 22 kikọ maksima, ko si awọn ohun kikọ pataki','Update subscription payment status in webhook only'=>'Imudojuiwọn ipo sisanwo alabapin ni webhook nikan','Enable Sandbox'=>'Mu Sandbox ṣiṣẹ','Yes'=>'Bẹẹni','No'=>'Rara','Verify SSL certificates'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn iwe-ẹri SSL','Verifies PayPal TLS certificates and hostname matches for server-side PayPal API requests.'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn iwe-ẹri PayPal TLS ati pe orukọ ẹrọ ibudo baamu fun awọn ìbéèrè API PayPal ti ẹgbẹ́ iṣẹ́.','PayPal Email'=>'Imeeli PayPal','Client ID'=>'ID Onibara','Secret'=>'Ikọkọ','PDT Token'=>'PDT Token','Sandbox Email'=>'Imeeli Sandbox','Sandbox Client ID'=>'ID Onibara Sandbox','Sandbox Secret'=>'Ikọkọ Sandbox','Sandbox PDT Token'=>'Sandbox PDT Token','Enable Tax'=>'Mu Owo-ori ṣiṣẹ','Price Entered'=>'Iye ti a tẹ','Show Price'=>'Fihan Iye','Enable VAT'=>'Mu VAT ṣiṣẹ','Merchant VAT Country'=>'Orilẹ-ede VAT Olukọ','Tax all EU Businesses'=>'Owo-ori gbogbo Awọn iṣowo EU','Disable VAT VIES database lookup'=>'Mu iṣawari database VAT VIES ṣiṣẹ','Reverse Charge Description'=>'Apejuwe Iṣejade Pada','VAT Reversal'=>'Iṣejade VAT','Invalid request.'=>'Ìbéèrè ti ko tọ.','You do not have permission to preview this email template.'=>'Iwọ ko ni ẹtọ lati wo awoṣe imeeli yii.','Email template could not be previewed.'=>'A ko le wo awoṣe imeeli.','You do not have permission to preview this product notification.'=>'Iwọ ko ni ẹtọ lati wo ikilọ ọja yii.','Email preview could not be generated.'=>'A ko le ṣẹda iwoye imeeli.','(no subject)'=>'(ko si koko-ọrọ)','(recipient resolved at send time)'=>'(olugba ti yan ni akoko ifijiṣẹ)','From'=>'Lati','To'=>'Si','You do not have permission to reset this email template.'=>'Iwọ ko ni ẹtọ lati tunṣe awoṣe imeeli yii.','Email template could not be reset.'=>'A ko le tunṣe awoṣe imeeli.','Using default'=>'Lilo aiyipada','You do not have permission to send this test email.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati fi imeeli idanwo yii ranṣẹ.','Test email could not be sent.'=>'Imeeli idanwo ko le ṣee fi ranṣẹ.','Please enter a valid email address to send the test to.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ adirẹsi imeeli to wulo lati fi idanwo ranṣẹ si.','[Test] %s'=>'[Idanwo] %s','Test email sent to %s.'=>'Imeeli idanwo ti firanṣẹ si %s.','Test email failed to send. Check your email/SMTP settings and try again.'=>'Imeeli idanwo kuna lati fi ranṣẹ. Ṣayẹwo awọn eto imeeli/SMTP rẹ ki o si tun gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Reports & Notifications'=>'Awọn iroyin & Awọn iwifunni','Order Received Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Gbigba Aṣẹ','Enable Facebook Ad Events'=>'Mú Facebook Ad Events ṣiṣẹ','Google Analytics Purchase Event Tracking'=>'Google Analytics Iṣẹ Rira Itọpa','Currency & Pricing'=>'Owó & Iye','Pages & Customer Account'=>'Awọn Oju-iwe & Akọọlẹ Onibara','Company & Branding'=>'Ile-iṣẹ & Iṣowo','Other Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Miiran','Classic card form'=>'Fọọmu kaadi aṣa','Legacy'=>'Iṣẹlẹ','Single card field on your checkout page. Supports order bumps and one-click upsells.'=>'Ibi kaadi kan ṣoṣo lori oju-iwe sisanwo rẹ. Ṣe atilẹyin awọn ikọlu aṣẹ ati awọn tita ti o tẹ kan.','Recommended'=>'Ti a ṣ推荐','Cards, Apple/Google Pay, and Link embedded in your checkout page. Supports order bumps and one-click upsells.'=>'Awọn kaadi, Apple/Google Pay, ati Link ti a fi sinu oju-iwe sisanwo rẹ. Ṣe atilẹyin awọn ikọlu aṣẹ ati awọn tita ti o tẹ kan.','Stripe-hosted page'=>'Oju-iwe ti o gbalejo nipasẹ Stripe','Redirects customers to a Stripe-hosted payment page. Most payment methods available (Klarna, Cash App Pay, and more via your Stripe dashboard).'=>'N tọka awọn onibara si oju-iwe sisanwo ti o gbalejo nipasẹ Stripe. Ọpọlọpọ awọn ọna sisanwo wa (Klarna, Cash App Pay, ati diẹ sii nipasẹ dashboard Stripe rẹ).','Order bumps and one-click upsells/downsells are not available in this mode. Coupons continue to work.'=>'Awọn ikọlu aṣẹ ati awọn tita ti o tẹ kan/ti o dinku ko wa ni ipo yii. Awọn kuponu tẹsiwaju lati ṣiṣẹ.','Built into Payment Element'=>'Ti a kọ sinu Ẹlẹẹke sisanwo','Built into the Stripe-hosted page'=>'Ti a kọ sinu oju-iwe ti o gbalejo nipasẹ Stripe','Stripe Connect server URL is not configured.'=>'URL olupin Stripe Connect ko ti ṣeto.','Stripe Connect live mode requires HTTPS for the site and return URL.'=>'Ipo gbigbe laaye Stripe Connect nilo HTTPS fun aaye naa ati URL ipadabọ.','Unable to generate an encryption key for Stripe Connect.'=>'Ko le ṣẹda bọtini ikọkọ fun Stripe Connect.','Connect server did not return a valid Stripe account ID.'=>'Ìkànsí asopọ ko pada ID akọọlẹ Stripe ti o tọ.','This Stripe Connect session is missing or expired. This can happen after a failed, abandoned, or restarted connection attempt. Reload this settings page and start the connection again.'=>'Iṣẹlẹ Stripe Connect yii padanu tabi ti pari. Eyi le ṣẹlẹ lẹhin igbiyanju asopọ ti kuna, ti a ti kọ silẹ, tabi ti a tun bẹrẹ. Tun oju-iwe eto yii ṣe atunkọ ki o si bẹrẹ asopọ lẹẹkansi.','SSL verification failed when retrieving keys from the connect server. Use a trusted certificate, or explicitly enable insecure local credential pickup for non-live local development.'=>'Iṣeduro SSL kuna nigba ti n gba awọn bọtini lati ọdọ olupin asopọ. Lo iwe-ẹri ti a gbagbọ, tabi ni kedere mu gbigba awọn iranti agbegbe ti ko ni aabo ṣiṣẹ fun idagbasoke agbegbe ti ko ni laaye.','Unable to retrieve Stripe API keys from the Connect server for this session. Reload this settings page and start the connection again.'=>'Ko le gba awọn bọtini API Stripe lati ọdọ olupin Connect fun iṣẹlẹ yii. Tun oju-iwe eto yii ṣe atunkọ ki o si bẹrẹ asopọ lẹẹkansi.','Stripe account connected successfully.'=>'A ti so akọọlẹ Stripe pọ pẹlu aṣeyọri.','Reconnect with Stripe'=>'Tun sopọ pẹlu Stripe','Connect with Stripe'=>'Sopọ pẹlu Stripe','Connect server not configured'=>'Sopọ olupin ko ti ṣeto','Set PPCART_STRIPE_CONNECT_SERVER_URL to your PublishPress intermediary URL.'=>'Set PPCART_STRIPE_CONNECT_SERVER_URL si URL alagbawo PublishPress rẹ.','1. Connect your Stripe account'=>'1. So akọọlẹ Stripe rẹ pọ','We sync your API keys automatically, then walk you through the webhook.'=>'A n ṣepọ awọn bọtini API rẹ laifọwọyi, lẹhinna a yoo dari ọ nipasẹ webhook.','Your saved keys are not direct Stripe keys, so reconnect before you continue.'=>'Awọn bọtini ti o fipamọ rẹ kii ṣe awọn bọtini Stripe taara, nitorina tun so pọ ki o to tẹsiwaju.','Stripe checkout is disabled. You can still connect now.'=>'Iṣowo Stripe ti wa ni pipa. O le tun so pọ ni bayi.','2. Install the webhook'=>'2. Fi webhook sii','Available after you connect.'=>'Wa lẹhin ti o so pọ.','Disconnect'=>'Pipade','Open in Stripe Dashboard'=>'Ṣii ninu Stripe Dashboard','Stripe is ready'=>'Stripe ti ṣetan','Keys synced'=>'Awọn bọtini ti ni asopọ','Webhook active with %d events'=>'Webhook ṣiṣẹ pẹlu %d iṣẹlẹ','1. Stripe account connected'=>'1. Akọọlẹ Stripe ti so pọ','Orders will not complete until this is done.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ko ni pari titi ti eyi yoo fi ṣẹlẹ.','Needs attention'=>'Nilo akiyesi','Not installed'=>'Ko ti fi sii','Fix the events'=>'Ṣatunṣe awọn iṣẹlẹ','Always enabled for PayPal API requests.'=>'Nigbagbogbo jẹ ki o ṣiṣẹ fun awọn ibeere PayPal API.','Leave blank to keep current value'=>'Fi silẹ fun lati pa iye lọwọlọwọ','Configured (value hidden)'=>'Ti ṣeto (iye ti a pamọ)','Mailchimp API Key'=>'Mailchimp API Bọtini','ActiveCampaign URL'=>'ActiveCampaign URL','ActiveCampaign Secret Key'=>'ActiveCampaign Bọtini Ẹ̀rọ','MemberVault URL'=>'MemberVault URL','MemberVault API Key'=>'MemberVault API Bọtini','SendFox API Key'=>'SendFox API Bọtini','MailPoet is active. Assign lists on each product’s Integrations settings — no API key is required.'=>'MailPoet ti wa ni iṣẹ. Yan awọn atokọ lori awọn eto Isopọ ọja kọọkan — ko si bọtini API ti a nilo.','Install and activate the MailPoet plugin to sync customers to lists. No API key is required.'=>'Fi sori ẹrọ ati muu ṣiṣẹ MailPoet plugin lati sopọ awọn alabara si awọn atokọ. Ko si bọtini API ti a nilo.','Add Payment Info'=>'Fikun-un Alaye Ìsanwó','Sends an AddPaymentInfo event to an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ AddPaymentInfo si fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa.','Requires Meta Pixel or another plugin/theme to load fbq on the checkout page.'=>'Nilo Meta Pixel tabi plugin/theme miiran lati gbe fbq lori oju-iwe isanwo.','Purchase Complete'=>'Ra Pari','Sends a Purchase event to an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ Rà lati fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa.','Lead Captured'=>'Oludari ti a gba','Sends a Lead event when a two-step checkout captures customer details.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ Lead nigbati isanwo igbesẹ meji ba mu alaye alabara.','Sends a purchase event to an existing Google Analytics or Data Layer installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ rira si fifi sori Google Analytics tabi Data Layer ti o wa.','Requires Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, or another plugin/theme to load ga, gtag, or dataLayer on the checkout page.'=>'Nilo Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, tabi plugin/theme miiran lati gbe ga, gtag, tabi dataLayer lori oju-iwe isanwo.','Sends a generate_lead event when a two-step checkout captures customer details.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ generate_lead nigbati isanwo igbesẹ meji ba mu alaye alabara.','Type'=>'Iru','Choose the event format that matches the analytics script already installed on this site.'=>'Yan ọna kika iṣẹlẹ ti o baamu iwe afọwọkọ itupalẹ ti a ti fi sori ẹrọ tẹlẹ lori aaye yii.','analytics.js'=>'analytics.js','Google Analytics 4'=>'Google Analytics 4','Universal Analytics'=>'Universal Analytics','DataLayer with GA4'=>'DataLayer pẹ̀lú GA4','DataLayer with Enhanced Ecommerce (UA)'=>'DataLayer pẹ̀lú Ecommerce Tó Gbooro (UA)','If you like %1$s, please leave us a %2$s rating. Thank you!'=>'Ti o ba fẹ́ %1$s, jọwọ fi wa silẹ àyẹyẹ %2$s. Ẹ ṣéun!','About PublishPress Cart'=>'Nipa PublishPress Cart','About'=>'Nipa','PublishPress Cart Documentation'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ PublishPress Cart','Documentation'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ','Contact the PublishPress team'=>'Kan si ẹgbẹ PublishPress','Contact'=>'Kan si','Categories'=>'Ẹka','Tags'=>'Tẹ́gí','Welcome to %s'=>'Kaabọ si %s','To get started, head over to the settings page to connect your Stripe account and select your currency. Once that\'s done, you\'ll be ready to create your first product!'=>'Lati bẹrẹ, lọ si oju-iwe eto lati sopọ iroyin Stripe rẹ ki o yan owo rẹ. Lẹ́yìn ti a ti ṣe eyi