tivation failed.'=>'Razorpay Addon pa aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon activated successfully.'=>'Square Addon ti wa ni pa aṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon deactivated successfully.'=>'Square Addon ti wa ni pa aṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon activation failed.'=>'Square Addon aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon deactivation failed.'=>'Square Addon pa aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Run referral, influencer, and affiliate programs effortlessly. Recruit partners, customize commission plans, and automate payouts. The trusted plugin to expand reach, boost sales, grow your brand, and maximize ROI.'=>'Ṣiṣe awọn eto itọkasi, awọn onimọran, ati awọn eto alafaramo laisi wahala. Pe awọn alabaṣiṣẹpọ, ṣe akanṣe awọn eto komisini, ki o si ṣe awopọ awọn isanwo. Ẹrọ afikun ti a gbẹkẹle lati fa arọwọto, mu awọn tita pọ, dagbasoke ami rẹ, ati pọ si ROI.','Offer global and local payment methods and get onboarded in minutes, with support in your language.'=>'Pese awọn ọna isanwo agbaye ati agbegbe ki o si forukọsilẹ ni iṣẹju diẹ, pẹlu atilẹyin ni ede rẹ.','Accept payments in your PublishPress Cart store with Razorpay. Integration and online onboarding included.'=>'Gba awọn isanwo ni ile itaja PublishPress Cart rẹ pẹlu Razorpay. Iṣọpọ ati forukọsilẹ lori ayelujara wa pẹlu.','Accepting payments is easy with Square. Clear rates, fast deposits (1-2 business days). Sell online and in person, and sync all payments, items and inventory.'=>'Gbigba awọn isanwo rọrun pẹlu Square. Awọn oṣuwọn kedere, awọn idogo yiyara (1-2 ọjọ iṣẹ). Ta lori ayelujara ati ni eniyan, ki o si mu gbogbo awọn isanwo, awọn nkan ati iṣura pọ.','New order manually created by %s'=>'Aṣẹ tuntun ti a ṣẹda laifọwọyi nipasẹ %s','Order updated by %s'=>'Aṣẹ ti ni imudojuiwọn nipasẹ %s','Configuration error: Missing AJAX settings. Please refresh the page.'=>'Aṣiṣe ìkonpẹ́: Àwọn àṣàyàn AJAX nìkan ni. Jọ̀wọ́ tún ojú-ìwé náà ṣe.','Subscription ID is missing.'=>'ID ìkànsí nìkan ni.','Sync subscription with Stripe?'=>'Ṣe ìkànsí pọ̀ pẹ̀lú Stripe?','