í','Failed Orders'=>'Àṣẹ tí kò ṣeé parí','Subscriptions Started'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ tí a bẹ̀rẹ̀','Trials Started'=>'Ìdánwò tí a bẹ̀rẹ̀','Subscriptions Canceled'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ tí a fagile','Coming up for the week of'=>'Tí ń bọ̀ fún ọ̀sẹ̀ ti','Coming up for'=>'Tí ń bọ̀ fún','Nothing found for this time period'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a rí fún àkókò yìí','Encryption enabled'=>'Iṣeduro ti ṣiṣẹ','Payment and integration credentials are encrypted at rest.'=>'Awọn iwe-ẹri sisanwo ati iṣọpọ ti wa ni iṣeduro ni iduro.','New credentials will be encrypted when saved.'=>'Awọn iwe-ẹri tuntun yoo jẹ iṣeduro nigbati a ba fipamọ.','Encryption disabled'=>'Iṣeduro ti ni idinamọ','Payment and integration keys are stored in plaintext by default. Enable encryption to reduce risk if your database is exposed.'=>'Awọn bọtini sisanwo ati iṣọpọ ni a tọju ni ọrọ gangan nipasẹ aiyipada. Mú iṣeduro ṣiṣẹ lati dinku ewu ti ibi ipamọ data rẹ ba han.','Enable encryption'=>'Mú iṣeduro ṣiṣẹ','Add %s to wp-config.php to enable encryption.'=>'Fi %s kun wp-config.php lati mu iṣeduro ṣiṣẹ.','Encryption is controlled by PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS in wp-config.php.'=>'Iṣeduro ni a ṣakoso nipasẹ PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS ninu wp-config.php.','Optional: lock encryption on in wp-config.php with %s'=>'Aṣayan: pa iṣeduro mọ ninu wp-config.php pẹlu %s','Open Security settings'=>'Ṣii awọn eto Aabo','Encryption'=>'Iṣeduro','Controlled by PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS in wp-config.php. The database setting is ignored.'=>'Ti a ṣakoso nipasẹ PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS ninu wp-config.php. Eto ibi ipamọ data ti wa ni ignor.','Encrypt payment and integration credentials in the database'=>'Ṣe àkọsílẹ ìsanwo àti ìmúlò àkọsílẹ nínú àkóónú data','For production sites, you can lock this in wp-config.php instead:'=>'Fun àwọn ibi ìṣelọpọ, o le pa eyi mọ́ nínú wp-config.php dipo:','When that constant is defined, it takes precedence and this checkbox is ignored.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá ṣàpèjúwe yìí, ó gba àkókò tó gaju àti pé a máa foju kọ́ àṣàyàn yìí.','Key source: %s'=>'Orísun bọtini: %s','Encryption cannot run until AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY is configured in wp-config.php.'=>'Àfihàn kò le ṣiṣẹ́ títí di pé AUTH_KEY tàbí PPCART_SECRETS_KEY ti jẹ́ àtúnṣe nínú wp-config.php.','Stored credentials'=>'Àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́','Encrypted: %d'=>'Ti a fipamọ́: %d','Plaintext: %d'=>'Rọrun: %d','While encryption is disabled, new and updated credentials are stored in plaintext. Existing encrypted values are not rewritten automatically; Cart continues to read them normally.'=>'Nígbà tí àfihàn ti wa ni pa, àwọn àkọsílẹ tuntun àti ti a ṣe àtúnṣe ni a fipamọ́ nínú ọrọ. Àwọn iye ti a fipamọ́ ti a fi àfihàn sílẹ̀ kò ni ṣe àtúnṣe laifọwọyi; Kárti máa ka wọn ní ìmọ̀lára.','%d credential remains encrypted in the database until you re-save it or enable encryption again.'=>'%d àkọsílẹ ti wa ni fipamọ́ nínú àkóónú data títí di pé o tún fipamọ́ rẹ̀ tàbí ki o mu àfihàn ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kansi.' . "\0" . '%d àkọsílẹ ti wa ni fipamọ́ nínú àkóónú data títí di pé o tún fipamọ́ wọn tàbí ki o mu àfihàn ṣiṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀kansi.','When you enable encryption, any plaintext credentials are encrypted automatically.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá mu àfihàn ṣiṣẹ́, gbogbo àkọsílẹ ọrọ ni a ó fipamọ́ laifọwọyi.','Last migration: %s'=>'Ìkó àtúnṣe tó kẹhin: %s','Enable encryption above or in wp-config.php before running migration.'=>'Mu àfihàn ṣiṣẹ́ lókè tàbí nínú wp-config.php kí o tó ṣiṣẹ́ ìkó àtúnṣe.','Rewrites existing plaintext payment and integration credentials in the database. Run during a maintenance window after taking a backup.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe àkọsílẹ ọrọ ìsanwo àti ìmúlò tó wà nínú àkóónú data. Ṣe iṣe yìí nígbà ìtẹ̀sí mẹ́ta lẹ́yìn tí o bá ti ṣe ẹ̀dá àkọsílẹ.','PublishPress Cart security'=>'Aabo Kárti PublishPress','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped, %3$d failed).'=>'Ti a fipamọ́ %1$d àkọsílẹ (%2$d ti kọ, %3$d ti kuna).','Do not change AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY without re-entering payment and integration keys in Cart settings.'=>'Má ṣe yí AUTH_KEY tàbí PPCART_SECRETS_KEY padà láì tún wọlé àkọsílẹ ìsanwo àti ìmúlò nínú àwọn àṣàyàn Kárti.','Some credentials could not be encrypted. Re-run migration from Cart → Settings → Maintenance or re-save keys manually.'=>'Diẹ ninu àkọsílẹ kò le jẹ́ àfihàn. Tun ṣiṣẹ́ ìkó àtúnṣe láti Kárti → Àṣàyàn → Itọju tàbí tún fipamọ́ àwọn bọtini rẹ̀ ní ọwọ́.','You do not have permission to change security encryption settings.'=>'O kò ni àṣẹ láti yí àwọn àṣàyàn àfihàn aabo pada.','Encryption disabled.'=>'Àfihàn ti wa ni pa.','Encryption enabled.'=>'Àfihàn ti wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ́.','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped, %3$d failed). Use Encrypt stored credentials in Maintenance to retry failures.'=>'Ti a fipamọ́ %1$d àkọsílẹ (%2$d ti kọ, %3$d ti kuna). Lo Ṣe àfihàn àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́ nínú Itọju láti tun ṣe ìkànsí.','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped).'=>'Ti a fipamọ́ %1$d àkọsílẹ (%2$d ti kọ).','You do not have permission to encrypt stored credentials.'=>'O kò ni àṣẹ láti ṣe àfihàn àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́.','Migration complete. Encrypted: %1$d. Skipped: %2$d. Failed: %3$d.'=>'Ìkó àtúnṣe pari. Ti a fipamọ́: %1$d. Ti kọ: %2$d. Ti kuna: %3$d.','Unavailable'=>'Ko si','Encryption is enabled but %d stored credential is still in plaintext. Use Encrypt stored credentials to retry.'=>'Àfihàn ti wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ́ ṣugbọn %d àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́ ṣi wà nínú ọrọ. Lo Ṣe àfihàn àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́ láti tún ṣe.' . "\0" . 'Àfihàn ti wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ́ ṣugbọn %d àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́ ṣi wà nínú ọrọ. Lo Ṣe àfihàn àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́ láti tún ṣe.','You have %d stored credential in plaintext. Enabling encryption will encrypt it automatically.'=>'O ní %d àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́ nínú ọrọ. Mú àfihàn ṣiṣẹ́ yóò ṣe àfihàn rẹ laifọwọyi.' . "\0" . 'O ní %d àkọsílẹ ti a fipamọ́ nínú ọrọ. Mú àfihàn ṣiṣẹ́ yóò ṣe àfihàn wọn laifọwọyi.','Encryption is not enabled. Enable it in Cart → Settings → Maintenance or add define( \'PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS\', true ); to wp-config.php.'=>'Àfihàn kò ti mú ṣiṣẹ́. Mu un ṣiṣẹ́ nínú Kárti → Àṣàyàn → Itọju tàbí fi define( \'PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS\', true ); sí wp-config.php.','Encryption requires AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY in wp-config.php.'=>'Àfihàn nilo AUTH_KEY tàbí PPCART_SECRETS_KEY nínú wp-config.php.','Canceled Stripe subscriptions cannot be resumed locally.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ Stripe tí a fagile kò le tún bẹ̀rẹ̀ ni agbegbe.','Invalid subscription.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ tí kò tọ́.','Stripe subscription is not linked to a PublishPress Cart subscription.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ Stripe kò ní ìbáṣepọ̀ pẹ̀lú ìforúkọsílẹ̀ Cart PublishPress.','This payment could not be verified. Please reload the page and try again.'=>'Àkọsílẹ yìí kò le jẹ́ ìmú ìmúlẹ̀. Jọ tún ṣe ìkó àtúnṣe náà.','%s order created.'=>'%s aṣẹ ti dá.','Order complete.'=>'Aṣẹ ti pari.','Creating subscription.'=>'Ṣiṣẹda iforukọsilẹ.','Products'=>'Awọn ọja','Category'=>'Ẹka','Tag'=>'Tẹg','Add New %s'=>'Fikun un Tuntun %s','Edit %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','New %s'=>'Tuntun %s','No %s Found'=>'Kò sí %s tí a ri','No %s Found in Trash'=>'Kò sí %s tí a ri nínú Àpò','Parent %s :'=>'Ìyá %s :','Search %s'=>'Wá %s','View %s'=>'Wo %s','Parent %s'=>'Ìyá %s','Parent %s:'=>'Ẹgbẹ %s:','Update %s'=>'Ṣatunkọ %s','New %s Name'=>'Orukọ %s Tuntun','accepted'=>'gba','Order status updated from %1$s to %2$s'=>'Ipo aṣẹ ti yipada lati %1$s si %2$s','Creating order.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ aṣẹ.','Coupon %s'=>'Kupon %s','Included in price'=>'Ti wa ninu iye','Download Receipt'=>'Gba Iwe-ẹri','Subscription status updated to %s'=>'Ipo ìforúkọsílẹ ti yipada si %s','This offer is no longer available.'=>'Pese yii ko si mọ.','This checkout could not be started. Please contact the site administrator.'=>'A ko le bẹrẹ ìtẹ̀siwaju yii. Jọwọ kan si alakoso aaye ayelujara.','There was a problem with your submission, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Iṣoro kan wa pẹlu ifisilẹ rẹ, jọwọ tun awọn oju-iwe naa ṣe ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Something went wrong, please refresh the page and try again. '=>'Nkan kan ṣẹlẹ ni aṣiṣe, jọwọ tun oju-iwe naa ṣe ki o si gbiyanju l